title "Smart metering"

# Containers hold elements; an edge may end on a container (Engineer -> Meter).
boundary Meter
  component Firmware
  component Comms module @comms
  Firmware -> @comms: Meter data

system HES
system Platform
  component Ingest
  component Store
  Ingest -> Store

actor Operator
actor Engineer
datastore Readings

@comms -> HES: DLMS/COSEM
HES -> Ingest: Events
Store -> Readings
Engineer -> Meter: Site visit
Operator ..> Platform: Alerts
